      {
        "id": 23854,
        "name": "Star Fox",
        "summary": "Star Fox is a video game for the Atari 2600 console, developed and published by Mythicon in 1983. Although the front cover of the game states \"Game 1 in Star Fox Series,\" no sequels were ever made, which is most likely because it received negative reception",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6af5.jpg",
